Description: An open R toolkit designed to support the teaching and
    learning of user experience (UX). Provides tools for calculating
    usability metrics, analysing usability studies, and generating
    reproducible simulations of synthetic UX data. Includes educational
    datasets and practical functions for exploring user behaviour,
    evaluating usability, and interpreting UX research results.
URL: https://pablosancheznunez.com
